<title>INDIA: Essar Shipping, S.India Shipping approve merger - PTI.</title>
<headline>Essar Shipping, S.India Shipping approve merger - PTI.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The boards of Essar Shipping Ltd and South India Shipping Corp Ltd have approved the merger of the firms into a single company, the Press Trust of India (PTI) quoted Essar group chairman S.N. Ruia as saying on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
